        "text_6ih8ag": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Selecting a diamond is a considered decision. The 4Cs, Cut, Colour, Clarity and Carat, were established by the Gemological Institute of America (GIA) and remain the universal framework for evaluating a diamond's quality. </p><p>At WILLIAM ÉDOUARD, every stone is measured against these criteria, ensuring each diamond we set performs with brilliance and character.</p>",
