          "settings": {
            "title": "Diamond Cut",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_h3yUWP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Cut is the mark of the human hand. It governs the way a diamond receives light, returns it to the eye, and comes alive in motion. Proportion, symmetry, and polish are considered together to determine a cut grade.</p><p>An exceptional cut reveals a diamond at its most luminous, unlocking its full brilliance, fire, and scintillation. A lesser cut, regardless of the quality of the rough, will always limit the stone’s potential. For this reason, particular importance is placed on cut when selecting a diamond.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_mCBBtL": {
