            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_May_4_2026_at_04_33_03_PM-2_50b7071e-a707-4b9c-8171-cd394b10c5d3.jpg",
            "heading": "Diamond Clarity",
            "body_text": "<p>Formed under immense pressure deep within the earth, most diamonds carry tiny natural characteristics known as inclusions. Clarity refers to the number, size and visibility of these internal features, and is graded on a scale from Flawless (FL) through to Included (I3), with VVS and VS sitting among the finer clarity ranges. <br/><br/>In the majority of fine diamonds, these characteristics are not visible to the naked eye and can only be seen under magnification. When well chosen, clarity allows a diamond to appear clean, bright and uninterrupted in its beauty.</p>",
            "button_label": "LEARN MORE",
            "button_link": "https://williamedouard.com/pages/diamond-clarity",
